OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fcontinuing this evening and overnight
OL,7,Fmixed with occasional clear spells,
OL,8,Fthough turning somewhat cloudier
OL,9,Fduring the early hours. Feeling
OL,10,Ffresher than previous nights with a
OL,11,Ffresh northwesterly breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA day of sunshine and
OL,14,Fshowers. Sunshine turning hazier later
OL,15,Fin the afternoon with outbreaks of
OL,16,Frain arriving from the west by the
OL,17,Fevening. Temperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
